{"id":"u-4a4efcfc-7097-4c1b-b91f-87cc7a19ad01","src":"community","title":"FBEOD Sondre","author":"Sondre T.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/TOkAMl-fbeod-sondre","desc":"After a great year using RAVARGE by G.V.S., I’ve sadly had to find a new program that fits my busy schedule.\n\nI work as a real estate agent in Norway, and I usually have limited time to train after work. I still love the gym, but given the choice between lifting and playing tennis for two hours, I’ll probably choose tennis. I just love playing sports more.\n\nEventually, I started skipping gym sessions altogether and eating a bit too much pizza and ice cream, haha. I wanted to make a change before my physique suffered, so I put together this program around the exercises I actually enjoy. Is it optimal? Probably not. But if it gets me back in the gym consistently, it works for me.\n\nI lift every other day. On the days in between, I do some form of cardio, usually a morning run and, if I have time after work, some sport.\n\nI’ve also noticed that I struggle to sleep if I don’t move at least a little every day. And not being able to sleep is torture.\n\nAnyway, if you have a busy schedule and want something you can get done in 60–90 minutes in the morning, give it a try and let me know what you think.\n\nBest of regards:)\n-Sondre","level":["Novice","Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength","Athletics"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-09-24T09:28:18.312Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":8,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":8,"rpe":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":8,"rpe":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Seated Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{